Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:46.14,0:00:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈在吧？我妈在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.15,0:00:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈是怎样的人?温柔吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.08,0:00:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很温柔\N很漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.15,0:01:00.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可怕?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.96,0:01:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可怕？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.10,0:01:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始紧张了\N我还是回去好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要回去比较好\N真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都来了啊\N也买了蛋糕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.11,0:01:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.11,0:01:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.12,0:01:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要好好打招呼才行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.05,0:01:35.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.13,0:01:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题吧?没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.06,0:01:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 妈妈在吗?\N妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.13,0:01:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N你回来啦 我回来了 幸会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫太一 太一?对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.14,0:01:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你女儿正在交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.15,0:02:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是祥子的母亲\N谢谢你总是跟他感情很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.09,0:02:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里\N感觉人很好嘛 你男友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:07.16,0:02:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人很好很体贴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.10,0:02:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母 这是点小心意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.10,0:02:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们了蛋糕来\N这么客气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.10,0:02:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 不用那么费心啦\N哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.04,0:02:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是贴心啊\N哪里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.11,0:02:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母\N关于这蛋糕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.05,0:02:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网络上评价很好\N很好吃的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.05,0:02:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？我们也还没吃过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.12,0:02:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那很期待啊\N不知道合不合你口味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.13,0:02:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起吃吧\N好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.07,0:02:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈看起来很温柔啊\N太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.15,0:03:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N请吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.16,0:03:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来好好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.10,0:03:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿茶来\N谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.04,0:03:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N不好意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.12,0:03:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是红茶吗?对 没问题?是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.05,0:03:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最爱了\N请喝 谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:32.10,0:04:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吃吧 是啊 可以享用吗?请
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.04,0:04:42.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吃吧 这蛋糕看起来很好吃啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.05,0:04:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是祥子说想吃的\N是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.05,0:04:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种的\N我不是很懂啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.12,0:04:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.06,0:05:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.14,0:05:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃\N太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.14,0:05:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说两人交往3个月了吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.15,0:05:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都去哪约会啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.09,0:05:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公园
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.09,0:05:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.10,0:05:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太一有很多优点的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.11,0:05:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈你能听我说吗?什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.04,0:05:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有100个左右\N有那么多?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.05,0:05:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 伯母 没事吧?没有被泼到吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.12,0:06:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母没有泼到你吗?\N我没事 你没事？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.06,0:06:07.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N我太粗心了 不会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.13,0:06:12.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来擦\N你等等哦 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.07,0:06:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太一你真是的\N抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.07,0:06:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.15,0:06:28.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太一你在看什么啊?\N妈妈都看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.15,0:06:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸?讨厌啊\N对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.09,0:06:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N抱歉啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.03,0:06:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈太粗心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.10,0:06:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N去我房间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.11,0:06:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再看我妈了\N抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.13,0:07:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在偷看吧?所以啊 那是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.13,0:07:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我看到了\N你看到了吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.07,0:07:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不小心看到的\N你看到了吧?我看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.07,0:07:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是\N故意去看的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.07,0:07:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法的事啊\N可是你一直在看哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.08,0:07:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啊\N就刚好进到视线里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.15,0:07:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?怎可能那样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.09,0:07:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是啊\N没办法啊 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不喜欢我啊?\N不 我喜欢祥子哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.03,0:07:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说过了吧?\N很漂亮的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.04,0:07:55.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我比起母亲\N比起妈妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.11,0:07:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不漂亮\N祥子你也很漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.04,0:08:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈比较漂亮啊\N才没有 算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.11,0:08:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么啊?\N祥子 那你能一直看着我吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.05,0:08:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然啊\N绝对不能看我妈哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祥子是最棒的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.13,0:08:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?当然啊都在交往了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.13,0:08:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?真的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.07,0:08:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只看祥子你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.08,0:08:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不要看我妈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.15,0:08:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能会听到哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.09,0:08:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.11,0:09:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说那种话啦\N知道了啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.08,0:10:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太一真是的...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:42.07,0:21:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N今天晚饭是什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:45.14,0:21:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚饭?太一你要留下来吃吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.14,0:21:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.08,0:21:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎办好呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.09,0:22:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做妈妈擅长的那个好了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.09,0:22:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.16,0:22:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是\N没有食材
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.17,0:22:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祥子\N你能去买来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.10,0:22:21.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去买?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.04,0:22:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈 因为有人来\N无法离开家里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.11,0:22:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能拜托你吗?妈妈不能去吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.12,0:22:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有客人要来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:37.06,0:22:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能拜托你吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:41.06,0:22:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦\N那我去买
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.13,0:22:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的?\N谢谢 那...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:51.07,0:22:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以拜托你买平常的那个吗?\N知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:54.14,0:22:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我去买了\N拜托了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:59.08,0:23:02.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去一下\N慢走 那我走了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:03.08,0:23:06.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:37.12,0:23:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的胸部 你没看到吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:43.12,0:23:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:48.06,0:23:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在看对吧?\N那个..
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:53.13,0:23:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是自己跑进视线里\N对不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.14,0:24:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母那个...不行啊\N那种事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:12.08,0:24:15.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是祥子的妈妈吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:17.16,0:24:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请别这样\N明明刚刚那样看了的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:21.16,0:24:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是..不行啊\N那样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.10,0:24:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想再看吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.11,0:24:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在说什么啊?伯母
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:42.11,0:24:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在祥子不在啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.05,0:24:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是伯母...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.12,0:24:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没穿胸罩吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.13,0:24:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种事不重要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:00.13,0:25:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多看点\N伯母
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:11.08,0:25:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想摸吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:19.08,0:25:22.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以不用忍耐哦\N可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:25.09,0:25:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:33.10,0:25:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好淫荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:38.04,0:25:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看的清楚吗?\N是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:49.11,0:25:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要摸摸看吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:55.12,0:25:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只有2人独处啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:01.13,0:26:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:10.07,0:26:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母\N再多摸点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:19.14,0:26:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翘起来了\N乳头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:24.08,0:26:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有点兴奋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:38.10,0:26:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也摸这边的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:45.04,0:26:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:51.04,0:26:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:56.12,0:26:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以多摸点吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:01.05,0:27:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:13.07,0:27:16.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真漂亮\N真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:27.08,0:27:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:31.08,0:27:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以接吻吗?\N想吻吗?想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:38.08,0:28:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以随便你摸哦\N可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:48.09,0:28:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:55.03,0:28:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:04.11,0:29:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以摸别的地方吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:13.05,0:29:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能来摸吗?我想摸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:26.13,0:29:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股可以吗?伯母
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:41.08,0:29:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:45.08,0:29:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁股...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:51.09,0:29:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒的屁股
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:56.16,0:29:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脚\N张开来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:00.17,0:30:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母\N好淫荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:05.10,0:30:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能再多看点吗?\N请让我看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:20.05,0:30:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:25.12,0:30:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从这边也能看到乳头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:38.07,0:30:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有看清楚吗?\N有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:43.14,0:30:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光这样看就很兴奋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:48.08,0:30:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好淫荡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:01.16,0:31:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为很久没被这样看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:05.16,0:31:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更加的兴奋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:10.10,0:31:13.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你老公很久没做了吗?
